  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "ANORITH was regenerated from a prehistoric fossil. This primitive POKéMON once lived in warm seas. It grips its prey firmly between its two large claws.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "ANORITH is said to be a type of POKéMON predecessor, with eight wings at the sides of its body. This POKéMON swam in the primordial sea by undulating these eight wings.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was resurrected from a fossil using the power of science. It swims by undulating the eight wings at its sides. They were feet that adapted to life in the sea.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a kind of POKéMON progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
